WEBVTT

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.830
There's no time. Do a final check!

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:15.500
Did you take out the marking pins from this?

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.790
Bring #5 over here!

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.330
How is that? Is it too tight?

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.500
No, it's fine.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.950
Thank you very much.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:26.540
Sorry for all the adjustments.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:30.120
Now please go to the makeup room, Miss Sudo.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:37.450
Finalists, please gather in the staging area
for the finalized show schedule.

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.290
I have to go, too.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:41.500
All right, I better go now.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.410
Um...

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:43.290
Huh?

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.660
Um... These pants...

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:48.410
...they're wonderful!

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:50.540
Thank you very much.

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:53.750
Today's the day.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.580
Why are you so desperate?

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:15.410
There's someone I want to crush.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:24.830
Huh?

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:27.790
Ah!

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:29.790
M-Mister...

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:37.450
Oh...

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:49.790
Miss Kokoro, let's participate in
the Geika Festival's fashion show!

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:14.450
I won't lose.

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:19.540
Me neither.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:51.290
"Smile Down the Runway"

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:00.370
"Episode 10: Must Not Lose"
I'll announce the order based off
the raffle from earlier.

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:06.410
Be aware of your position and
act according to the timetable.

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:08.700
I'll post the details here.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.450
It's so big!

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.620
It's amazing, isn't it?

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:24.620
The Geika Festival fashion show
will start momentarily.

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:28.580
Please welcome today's panel of judges.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:33.790
Japan's most popular top model, Miss Sara.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:40.580
The designer behind the popular young adult
clothing brand, Quintiz, Mr. Kazuya Suo.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:45.830
Chief editor of fashion magazine,
<i>Hoen</i>, Ms. Kinu Kamii.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:52.290
And finally, the Geika Fashion School
principal, Ms. Shoko Takaoka.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:56.830
With this all-star lineup of judges,
the show will now kick off!

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.950
Well, shall we switch seats?

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:05.500
No way. I'm in no position to critique others.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:13.120
If you're not, then I'm a huge
embarrassment sitting here, Ms. Ayano.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:17.750
This is more like a class
visitation for me anyways.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.950
I'll refrain from making smart remarks today.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:25.000
Now, I wonder if there's
anyone interesting today.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:30.160
It started!

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.200
Hmph.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.410
You!

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.830
Oh.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:06:00.040
You're not wearing your usual Lale Fauns today.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.330
Please!

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:08.660
It's none of your business.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:11.000
We might as well watch the show together.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.910
What?! No way.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:17.250
You're so harsh towards the young people,
but you can't even make an entrance?

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.620
How embarrassing.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.910
I'll kill you...

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.120
Wow.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:30.830
There's a lot of people around Ikuto's age
who can make amazing clothes...

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.580
It's true.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:35.410
The audience is full of stylish people, too.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.200
This is Geika, after all.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:40.790
Mother, you should've dressed up more too.

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.410
I'm good just like this.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.830
Is it Iku's turn yet?

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:51.500
It'll be his turn soon,
so be a good girl, okay?

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:55.370
I'm... going to run to the restroom.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:57.250
Are you okay?

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.750
It's just... I'm getting nervous!

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:05.000
Don't worry! I bet Ikuto's
more relaxed than you are.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:09.410
My stomach hurts...

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:11.500
I'm so nervous...!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:39.450
I have to hurry back for the final check.

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:42.080
Huh?

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:45.410
#7! The double woven obi and
accessories are out of balance.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.750
Adjust its position and
make it work on the model.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.410
Hey, where's the silk thread?

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:51.580
We just ran out. Let's use a safety pin--

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:52.950
It's okay!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:56.120
Use polyester thread instead!
Then you'll just need to adjust the size.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.660
We still have time.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.830
My turn is right before yours.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:07.250
I'm going to steal the audience and crush you!

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:15.410
I guess Toh Ayano is the most
noteworthy designer here.

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:21.200
He might be. Especially since he's
the grandchild of the great Ms. Mai Ayano.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.540
What's taking Honoka so long?

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:28.790
I'm sure she'll be back any minute.

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:31.700
What? Are you getting nervous, too, Aoi?

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.370
Nervous? Me?

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:44.830
Well...

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:48.040
I like it. It's edgy.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:50.120
Using leather to create Japanese clothes.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:56.790
Fitter! When the model comes back,
get them changed in 30 seconds.

00:08:56.790 --> 00:09:01.120
--That day... Ikuto Tsumura completely ruined
Hajime Yanagida's fashion show.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:03.910
--Is she okay? She's one of Mr. Yanagida's staff.
--That day... Ikuto Tsumura completely ruined
Hajime Yanagida's fashion show.

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:05.790
Wait... This can't be good.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.790
Is there anyone who can sew in her place?

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.750
No, there's no one available.

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:12.000
What? There's no replacement?

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:14.040
Does anyone know how to sew?

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:19.120
I'll do it.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:28.580
The original design of that dress
was more elegant and delicate.

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:35.370
But by adjusting it to fit that short model,
the dress became flashy.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:38.750
But... at that moment...

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:41.500
...I didn't raise my hand.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:44.500
Why do I despise Ikuto Tsumura?

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:47.500
Because he ruined Mr. Hajime's show?

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.950
No.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:52.250
Because he completely departed
from Mr. Hajime's concept?

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:53.410
No.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:59.540
That time... when I heard
the audience's applause...

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:03.620
...I was swept away by it.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.620
This is the last one!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.000
Go!

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:12.620
I thought I lost...

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:17.830
Why do I despise Ikuto Tsumura?
It's because...

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:19.910
...I hate to lose.

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:30.120
Ah...

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:35.660
My, what flames of passion.

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:42.700
They made good use of the billowing skirt
to achieve a good mix of kimono and dress.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:48.500
What a beautiful silhouette.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:53.160
If I don't give any praise,
it will come back to me.

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:57.870
Using an unforgiving material
like leather to make a kimono...

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:01.160
Her knowledge and technique
to achieve this look...

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:03.830
It's all impressive, Kaoru.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:07.700
I want to wear that second kimono to Cannes.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:16.040
A bit too influenced by that designer...
Yanagida, was it?

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.410
But anyway...

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:25.160
The audience is excited,
that should be taken into account.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.950
E-Excuse me.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:34.660
Sorry, I wasn't being careful either.

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:36.910
Come on, let's go to the front.

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:39.580
Why do I have to go with you?

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:43.200
I was asked to record the next show,

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.910
since they won't be able to.

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:48.910
Try raising your arm up a little.

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:51.250
Yup, it's good.

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.580
Kanami, what time is it right now?

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.080
It's almost 2:50 pm.

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:57.330
Okay.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:04.250
Now it's finally time for Ikuto's show.

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:16.500
It's finally... my turn!

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:20.910
I never even considered before now

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:24.450
that there are good clothes and bad clothes...

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:28.370
I'm about to be evaluated based on that idea.

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:36.040
A lot has happened until this moment...
It wasn't all just fun.

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:38.790
My dream is to become a fashion designer.

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:41.870
Runway, here I come!

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:43.200
Smile.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:47.540
This is it, everyone!

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.410
We got this!

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:54.910
I'm going to enjoy it...
Showing my collection to everyone!

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:58.000
All right everyone, it's show time!

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:01.750
<i>Smile Down the Runway.</i>

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:05.080
Oh? She's back.

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:06.870
You're a weirdo, Honoka.

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:08.450
So emotional.

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:11.450
I'm fine now. Stop being annoying.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.540
I calmed myself down.

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:20.620
It's about to start, so if you have to go-- Huh?

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:28.500
Blue... lights...

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.750
Those shoes...

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.950
You only wear them
for special occasions right, Aoi?

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:37.910
What...? Oh, yeah...

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:44.700
I made blue gloves just for you, Aoi.

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.790
Wow!

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.620
Handmade gloves?

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:51.450
Is your brother a girl?

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:56.750
I hate these gloves!

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:09.790
This is Noka's favorite song.

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:11.580
It takes me back...

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:25.200
It's a ribbon!

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:28.500
This is undoubtedly Ikuto's show.

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:31.660
Doesn't it make you happy?

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:39.750
Aoi, why are you crying?

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:43.200
You were just giving me
a hard time about it.

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:48.370
I want... Ikuto to win.

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:53.830
I want him to win and brag
about how amazing he is!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:58.870
Ikuto's giving it his all.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.540
He's here to win.

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:05.410
Crossing boundaries...
Finding harmony between genders.

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:11.370
Pattern on pattern of tartan and pin checks...
Reminiscent of Britain...

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:17.080
An outfit designed so that only
a tall model could pull it off.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.250
My guess is...

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:22.580
...this collection will take us
around the world.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:29.250
His concept is crystal clear
right off the bat. Way to go, Ikuto!

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:31.160
You're not going to cry, Mommy?

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.080
Who? Mommy?

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.120
Mommy's not going to cry.

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:38.540
What? Mother. I'm not crying, okay?

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.870
Honoka's the one crying.

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.870
Ouch. Don't pinch me!

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:47.330
Mother never cries.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:49.790
Even Ikuto said he's never seen her cry.

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:53.200
I cry... I'm sobbing in my heart.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.620
Sure, sure.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.580
Your walk was great!

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:00.790
Please keep it up for the next outfit!

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:01.910
Yes.

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.500
Wow.

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:08.790
The second and third outfits are Scandinavia.

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.790
The fourth outfit is Italy.

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:16.370
Elegant palazzo pants featuring lace
that originated in Sicily.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.450
Then next up...

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.500
I knew it!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:26.250
He used a traditional Italian
embroidery method, too.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:31.580
Society tends to praise the "unpredictable."

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:36.660
But when it's predictable, it means that
the idea is grounded with clear intention.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.870
What do you think is next?

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:41.750
Don't talk to me.

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:43.540
Here it comes.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:45.120
It's Japan.

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:49.830
The runway... It's still bright white.

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:54.080
But for some reason...
my legs are moving on their own.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:59.500
The top is made with thick fabric,
but the shorts are made with stretchy denim.

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:02.700
The sleeves are lace, so my arms feel light.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:05.660
The first outfit and now this one...

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:09.000
...it's carefully made with the wearer in mind.

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:10.000
"Kaoru Kizaki
Ikuto Tsumura
Kokoro Hasegawa"

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.620
"Kaoru Kizaki
Ikuto Tsumura
Kokoro Hasegawa"
Ikuto Tsumura...

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:17.370
Igarashi, didn't you have a problem
with this designer, too?

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:21.450
What do you think, as a former model yourself?

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.500
The model's into it.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:25.080
Yup.

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:29.750
I totally get it! When the clothes
are well-made, it fires you up!

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:34.200
A model's aura is like a drop
of water on drawing paper.

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:38.830
The concept is like color in the drop,
and it spreads out.

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:42.870
When the model is talented,
the drawing paper is completely saturated.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:46.290
When that happens, the outfit's
concept comes through powerfully.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:51.540
The show's concept was apparent
from the first outfit.

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.580
I wonder what's next.

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.750
A change of direction.

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:02.580
American fashion?

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:04.830
It's flashy and bold.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.290
Plus, it's oldies style.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:11.620
This is the seventh outfit.

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:15.830
Ikuto's going to present a total of ten outfits.

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:20.160
Maybe he's amping things up for the finale now.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:26.160
Usually, the key outfit
is presented first or last.

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:29.000
My bet's on America again for the eighth outfit.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:33.080
The ninth outfit could be
the military style of Germany.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:36.200
And for the finale, the tenth outfit...

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:41.790
The eighth outfit is Germany?!

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:43.910
Unpredictable all of a sudden.

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:45.370
What's next?

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:49.410
What? France for the ninth outfit?!

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:52.080
A brilliant aristocratic style?

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:53.910
The last one is next...

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:56.500
Will it be France one more time?

00:18:56.500 --> 00:19:01.660
I'm sure everyone expects to see
France for the finale.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.410
An arrangement that deliberately
defies people's expectations.

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:06.160
How bold...

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:10.000
I wonder who he learned it from.

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:14.290
This designer's "wa" is about unisex.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.160
Harmony of the genders.

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:18.580
Then, the tenth must be...

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:24.700
The final outfit... This is it!

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.660
Take it away!

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.830
I see...

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:42.330
Stripped of any element of brilliance...

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:44.290
A universal style that belongs
to all countries...

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:47.000
And defies all other concepts.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.370
Clothing for anyone.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.200
Well done.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:54.250
I would do the same.

00:19:57.410 --> 00:20:00.910
Stripped of all unnecessary components,
the ultimate minimalism.

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:05.040
Making minimalist clothing
is a tremendous challenge.

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:07.620
In food, it's like preparing meat.

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:13.450
You don't need other ingredients
to accompany it, or sauce to augment it.

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:17.080
All you do is sew the material just as it is.

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:20.790
Everything depends on the creator's talent.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.410
He got us, didn't he?

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:27.040
Yes! Never expected that one as the finale!

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:29.540
I would've never guessed.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.160
Nobody saw it coming.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.040
Ikuto Tsumura...

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.500
He's a non-student participant.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.290
He is?!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.620
It says he's still a high school student.

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:43.700
The slightest wrinkle sticks out like
a sore thumb in this type of clothing.

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.910
So if the pattern was a millimeter off,
it would ruin the whole outfit.

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:50.950
But look how beautiful the silhouette is.

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:52.790
It's very well-made.

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:54.910
Here.

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:58.330
What's that? Did you make it for Mommy?

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:04.250
You're amazing! I can't believe it's
your first time. Thank you so much.

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:06.620
It's a little wrinkly though.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:10.790
Wow!

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.330
Aoi?

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:21.410
Huh?

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:23.910
Could you hold Ichika for a second?

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:25.410
Mother...?

00:21:32.910 --> 00:21:37.080
Ikuto! That was amazing!

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:39.250
Oh... Ah...

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:43.410
You've come such a long way.

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:50.830
But I couldn't do anything for you after all...

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:58.540
That's why I promised myself to smile
and never cry in front of you kids...

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:01.040
So you won't get worried...

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:02.950
What? Are you crying?

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:05.120
Mother's crying?!

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:10.000
But... Today's an exception... Okay?

00:22:17.700 --> 00:22:19.290
Thank you...

00:23:59.160 --> 00:24:01.830
Listen to that applause...

00:24:01.830 --> 00:24:05.250
Ikuto must've had a good show.

00:24:05.250 --> 00:24:07.080
I think you're right.

00:24:07.080 --> 00:24:08.910
I was just talking to myself.

00:24:08.910 --> 00:24:11.540
Oh, um, should I not respond?

00:24:11.540 --> 00:24:14.040
Well, duh.

00:24:14.040 --> 00:24:19.500
Because we're not collaborating
as friends, right?

00:24:19.500 --> 00:24:22.000
Exactly.

00:24:22.000 --> 00:24:24.200
You better fulfill my promise.

00:24:24.200 --> 00:24:25.620
Yes.

00:24:25.620 --> 00:24:28.330
Next up, Kokoro Hasegawa.

00:24:29.500 --> 00:24:30.750
Let's go.

00:24:32.040 --> 00:24:33.950
Next, "The Promise."

00:24:33.950 --> 00:24:36.910
"See you next time!!"
